{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01CFveBzwkjffsaY2c2nowQX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the task carefully:\n\n1. I need to create three test files for the `pkg/sys` package:\n   - `pkg/sys/terminal_test.go` - Tests for TerminalWidth and IsTerminal\n   - `pkg/sys/stat_test.go` - Tests for Stat, Lstat, and FileInfo field population\n   - `pkg/sys/signal_test.go` - Tests for InstallSIGPIPEHandler and OnTerminalResize\n\n2. I need to review the PRD for sys to understand the full requirements.\n\nLet me first read the PRD file since it's listed in required reading but not provided in the source code section.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":28411,"cache_read_input_tokens":16066,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":28411},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f56086e5-e78b-4262-915f-30e16e3713ef","uuid":"11bef0e0-1bd1-4cb2-8176-68685e5a7504"}
